     "description": "1995 Western Conference Semifinals OT Winner #1: On May 25, 1995, Chelios closed out Game 3 of the Western Conference Semifinals versus the Vancouver Canucks at Pacific Coliseum. In the first overtime, Bernie Nicholls found Chelios entering the offensive zone where No. 7 faked a slap shot, freezing goaltender Kirk McLean and sliding in a goal that propelled the Hawks to a 3-0 series lead. Chicago would go on to sweep the series and advance to the Western Conference Final versus the rival Detroit Red Wings.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
